      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T15:12:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What sort of analysis do these deallocation checks actually perform? That would help me understand how often we\u0027d want to skip them. My gut feeling is that most places we\u0027d want to skip them, we\u0027d also be excluding the use of raw_ptr for performance already. Would that have the same effect?",
