      "message": "Do you have any thoughts on how based to put this in Skia?\n\n* Make a macro SK_SCOPED_SAFETY_CHECK_EXCLUSION that is nothing in non-chrome?\n\n* Make a define SK_USE_SAFETY_CHECKS that provides a null impl if no fined?\n\n* Make a class SKScopedSafetyCheckExclusion that inherits or \u0027using\u0027 the partition alloc one if some compile time flag is set?\n\n* Do something like this CL that makes base::ScopedSafetyChecksExclusion if one doesn\u0027t exist?",
